    "result_text": "BUILD SUCCESS \u2014 the full suite passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `checkDigit` (a single Luhn check digit over the digits of `customerCode`) with minimal structural impact:\n\n1. **New `CheckDigit.java`** (self-contained helper, following the existing `Locality`/`CheckUniqueIdentity` pattern) \u2014 one small static method that computes the Luhn digit, matching the test's `luhn` algorithm exactly (rightmost digit doubled, alternating; returns `null` when `customerCode` is absent).\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 one added `@Mapping` line delegating to `CheckDigit.checkDigit(owner)`, mirroring how `identityKey`/`locality` are already wired. No existing method body changed.\n\n3. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the `checkDigit` property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\nBy putting the logic in a new cohesive class rather than growing `OwnerMapper` or an existing function, the only code method touched is the mapper's `toOwnerDto` (a low-complexity single line addition), keeping the WMC-driven cost small.",
